msgid "PressHangar Draft Pacer"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: presshangar-draft-pacer.php
msgid "https://presshangar.com/presshangar-draft-pacer"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: presshangar-draft-pacer.php
msgid ""
"Source-agnostic natural pacing publishing layer for WordPress drafts, by "
"PressHangar (a brand of Musubiemu LLC). Schedules drafts as \"future\" posts"
" with human-like intervals and guarantees zero missed publications via a "
"self-healing watchdog. Does not generate any content."
msgstr ""
"Capa de publicación con ritmo natural, independiente del origen, para "
"borradores de WordPress, de PressHangar (una marca de Musubiemu LLC). "
"Programa los borradores como entradas «futuras» con intervalos realistas y "
"garantiza cero publicaciones perdidas mediante un perro guardián "
"autorreparable. No genera ningún contenido."

#. Author of the plugin
#: presshangar-draft-pacer.php
msgid "Musubiemu LLC"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
